cites p. 40 (the Knesset provision)."},{"title_he":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת (תיקון מס' 49)","title_en":"Basic Law: The Knesset (Amendment No. 49)","passage_date":"2020-06-15","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תש\"ף 2800, עמ' 70 (16.6.2020)","amends":["חוק-יסוד: הכנסת","חוק-יסוד: הממשלה"],"principal_subject":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת","kind":"amendment","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20250112191941/https://www.nevo.co.il/law_html/law01/190_001.htm","https://web.archive.org/web/20200617135333/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/23/law/23_lsr_573903.pdf"],"note":"Amends s. 23, adds s. 42C and amends s. 43 (permanent 'Norwegian law'); includes an indirect amendment of Basic Law: The Government (gazette: 'תיקון עקיף: מס' 9'). Nevo cites pp. 70 and 72."},{"title_he":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת (תיקון מס' 50 – הוראת שעה)","title_en":"Basic Law: The Knesset (Amendment No. 50 – Temporary Provision)","passage_date":"2020-08-24","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תש\"ף 2845, עמ' 420 (24.8.2020)","amends":["חוק-יסוד: הכנסת","חוק-יסוד: משק המדינה (תיקון מס' 10 והוראת שעה לשנת 2020)"],"principal_subject":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת","kind":"temporary provision","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20250112191941/https://www.nevo.co.il/law_html/law01/190_001.htm","https://web.archive.org/web/20210515052710/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/23/law/23_lsr_581313.pdf"],"note":"Reads s. 36A(b) with a budget deadline of 23 December 2020 for the period from commencement to that date (Nevo: in force 24.8.2020 to 23.12.2020); s. 2 amends Basic Law: The State Economy (Amendment No. 10 and Temporary Provision for 2020) (gazette: 'תיקון עקיף: מס' 4'). Court annotation seen on Hebrew Wikipedia: HCJ 5969/20 Shafir v. Knesset (23 May 2021) issued a 'nullification warning' describing the provision as abuse of constituent power. Passed and published the same day."},{"title_he":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת (תיקון מס' 51)","title_en":"Basic Law: The Knesset (Amendment No. 51)","passage_date":"2021-07-06","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תשפ\"א 2914, עמ' 368 (7.7.2021)","amends":["חוק-יסוד: הכנסת","חוק-יסוד: משק המדינה"],"principal_subject":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת","kind":"amendment","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20250112191941/https://www.nevo.co.il/law_html/law01/190_001.htm","https://web.archive.org/web/20260125145251/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/24/law/24_lsr_603565.pdf"],"note":"Amends s. 36A(b) (budget deadline after a government is formed) and s. 42C(d) (larger quotas under the 'Norwegian law'); indirect amendment of Basic Law: The State Economy (gazette: 'תיקון עקיף: מס' 12')."},{"title_he":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת (תיקון מס' 52)","title_en":"Basic Law: The Knesset (Amendment No. 52)","passage_date":"2023-01-23","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תשפ\"ג 3013, עמ' 8 (24.1.2023)","amends":["חוק-יסוד: הכנסת"],"principal_subject":"חוק-יסוד: הכנסת","kind":"amendment","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20250112191941/https://www.nevo.co.il/law_html/law01/190_001.htm","https://web.archive.org/web/20260125145230/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/25/law/25_lsr_1652182.pdf"],"note":"Amends s. 42C (adds s. 42C(a1); new quotas in s. 42C(d))."},{"title_he":"חוק-יסוד: הממשלה (תיקון מס' 13)","title_en":"Basic Law: The Government (Amendment No. 13)","passage_date":"2025-05-12","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תשפ\"ה 3411, עמ' 634 (13.5.2025)","amends":["חוק-יסוד: הממשלה","חוק-יסוד: הכנסת"],"principal_subject":"חוק-יסוד: הממשלה","kind":"amendment","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20250112191941/https://www.nevo.co.il/law_html/law01/190_001.htm","https://web.archive.org/web/20250621061228/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/25/law/25_lsr_6802943.pdf","https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הממשלה"],"note":"INDIRECT amendment: s. 5 carries the margin 'תיקון חוק-יסוד: הכנסת – מס' 53' and deletes the alternate-Prime-Minister references in s. 42C (the law repeals ss. 43A-43H of Basic Law: The Government); commencement with the 26th Knesset. Wikisource's Knesset page labels it 'תיקון מס' 13 לחוק-יסוד: הממשלה' and its bot edit summary calls it 'תיקון מס' 53'. Not in the Nevo capture used (12 January 2025); Nevo's live page (current to 22.12.2025) carries the consolidated text only."}],"ordinary_statute_amendments":[{"title_he":"חוק כינוס הכנסת (הוראת שעה), התשמ\"ה-1985","title_en":"Convening of the Knesset (Temporary Provision) Law, 5745-1985","passage_date":"1985-07-31","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תשמ\"ה 1155, עמ' 196 (7.8.1985)","relation":"Ordinary statute; a 'notwithstanding s. 33 of Basic Law: The Knesset' temporary provision on convening the Knesset at the demand of members; does not alter the text. Listed in Wikisource's publication line; absent from Nevo's footnotes.","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20210515042336/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/11/law/11_lsr_210440.pdf"]},{"title_he":"חוק כינוס הכנסת (הוראת שעה), התשמ\"ט-1989","title_en":"Convening of the Knesset (Temporary Provision) Law, 5749-1989","passage_date":"1989-05-30","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תשמ\"ט, עמ' 58 (issue number not captured)","relation":"Ordinary statute; same 'notwithstanding s. 33' device as the 1985 law. Listed in Wikisource's publication line; absent from Nevo's footnotes.","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20210515053009/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/12/law/12_lsr_210744.pdf"]},{"title_he":"חוק הכנסת (מספר החברים בועדות), התשנ\"ד-1994","title_en":"Knesset (Number of Members in Committees) Law, 5754-1994","passage_date":"1994-04-25","date_basis":"passed","gazette":"ס\"ח תשנ\"ד 1462, עמ' 140 (4.5.1994)","relation":"Ordinary statute whose s. 2 repeals s. 21(c) of Basic Law: The Knesset; the gazette margin reads 'תיקון חוק-יסוד: הכנסת – מס' 16' and Nevo lists it as 'תיקון מס' 16'. Wikisource labels it 'חוק הכנסת (מספר חברים בועדות)'. This is why No. 16 does not appear among the entries.","source":["https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/חוק-יסוד:_הכנסת","https://web.archive.org/web/20250112191941/https://www.nevo.co.il/law_html/law01/190_001.htm","https://web.archive.org/web/20260208185825/https://fs.knesset.gov.il/13/law/13_lsr_203746.pdf"]}],"discrepancies":["1974 law: Wikisource (and the gazette title) 'תיקון מס' 8'; Nevo 'תיקון מס' 5 [במקור מס' 8]'. Two laws therefore bear the published title 'חוק-יסוד: הכנסת (תיקון מס' 8)' (1974 and 1981) and none the title 'תיקון מס' 5'.","Wikisource's publication line includes two ordinary temporary laws, חוק כינוס הכנסת (הוראת שעה) תשמ\"ה (p. 196) and תשמ\"ט (p. 58); Nevo's amendment footnotes do not reference them.","Wikisource labels the five indirect Basic-Law amendments by the amending law's title ('חוק-יסוד: הממשלה' x2, 'תיקון לחוק-יסוד: הממשלה', 'תיקון מס' 8 והוראת שעה לחוק-יסוד: הממשלה', 'תיקון מס' 13 לחוק-יסוד: הממשלה') and the 1994 Knesset Law by its title, without Knesset amendment numbers; Nevo numbers them 15, 30, 40, 48, 53 and 16, and the gazette margins carry the same numbers.","Amendment No. 19: Nevo annotates '(בוטל על ידי תיקון מס' 21)'; Wikisource lists it without comment.","Page references: Wikisource cites the first page of each amending law (e.g. תש\"ף 34 for the 2020 Government law), Nevo the page of the Knesset provision (p. 40); likewise תשס\"א 166 vs 166-167, תשע\"ה 248 vs 248-249, תש\"ף 70 vs 70 and 72. Nevo additionally gives issue numbers and dates, which Wikisource omits.","Nevo's live page (current to 22.12.2025) no longer shows an amendments table; the table was taken from the Internet Archive capture of 12 January 2025 of the same URL (full footnoted format) and cross-checked with the WIPO Lex mirror of Nevo's 2015 text. Coverage of Nevo's table therefore ends at Amendment No. 52; No. 53 rests on the gazette PDF and Wikisource.","Hebrew Wikipedia (cross-check only): infobox gives 'מספר תיקונים = 52', which equals the 52 Basic-Law-titled amending laws here (47 direct + 5 indirect); its 'major amendments' list mislabels the 1 April 1981 law that added ss. 42A-42B as 'תיקון מס' 10' (it is No. 7) and gives 7 March 2001 for 'תיקון מס' 30' (consistent with the gazette)."],"deviations":["fs.knesset.gov.il and main.knesset.gov.il are geo-blocked (HTTP 303 to a maintenance page); every one of the 56 gazette PDFs linked from Wikisource was obtained from Internet Archive captures (2019-2026) and the 'נתקבל/התקבל בכנסת ביום' footnote read from each (PDFKit text layer; pre-2008 files are OCR layers over scans and the Hebrew and Gregorian dates were checked against each other). Archived copies of the Knesset's own law page (lawitemid 2000037) are obfuscated scripts and were not usable.","Nevo: no login was needed for the static page law01/190_001.htm, but it now carries only the consolidated text; its ajax endpoints (/ajax/laws/law/...) return empty bodies and its gazette PDFs (Law_word/law14/LAW-NNNN.pdf) redirect to a login page. The 2025 archive capture supplied the footnoted table.","Nothing after Basic Law: The Government (Amendment No. 13) (12 May 2025) was found: Wikisource's last bot sync (9 August 2026) changed only procedure cross-references; Nevo's live text is current to 22 December 2025 with no new provision; web searches for 'תיקון מס' 54' returned nothing. The window December 2025 to 22 October 2026 could not be verified against the Knesset database itself.","Counting: 53 entries = enactment + 47 direct amendments (Nos. 1-14, 17-29, 31-39, 41-47, 49-52, with the 1974 law counted once under its published title 'No. 8') + 5 indirect amendments by Basic-Law-titled laws (Nevo Nos. 15, 30, 40, 48, 53). No. 16 is an ordinary statute (listed separately). Wikisource's 56 references = these 53 + the three ordinary laws.","'amends' lists only Basic Laws touched by each law (ordinary laws amended alongside, e.g. the Knesset Elections Law by No. 9, are mentioned in notes only). Section-level effects in notes come from the gazette texts and the Wikisource/Nevo section tags and were not independently re-verified for every entry.","Issue number of ס\"ח תשמ\"ט p. 58 (1989 convening law) was not captured. Hebrew Wikipedia was used only for the count and the court annotation on No. 50."]}
